{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>股評人梁杰文於節目中推介康師傅(322)，指上半年純利升7.1%，同時毛利率升1.3個百分點、至35.8%，目前提供7.5厘股息率具吸引力，認為內需股在大市缺乏方向時，會有資金追入。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"3323.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026vc1sC5kkzE1793168011.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>梁杰文認為稍微回落至12元可買入，目標價上望14元，若失守11.2元便止蝕。</p><p></p><p>康師傅(322)</p><p>股評人買賣策略</p><p>買入：$12<br/>目標：$14</p><p>止蝕：$11.2</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"3324.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026KpDCrkQA4Z1793168003.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>股評人阮子曦推介百濟神州(6160)，一來美國容許大部分中國藥物許可協議是較大利好，另外旗下產品面臨多條線路盈利期，相信稍後業績會陸續反映。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"3325.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026SInY3wYel01793168035.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>阮子曦認為現價、即222元便可買入，目標價看250元，止蝕價在200元，較保守的投資者不妨再等價格低一點。</p><p></p><p>百濟神州(6160)</p><p>股評人買賣策略</p><p>買入：現價→$222</p><p>目標：$250</p><p>止蝕：$200</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"3326.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Qh7jt59I401793168050.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T07:21:56.814022+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":341,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T06:12:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T10:38:33.976068+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T07:18:22.713328+00:00","content_hash":"50b9b7565701900beb2914d26d36c3443ddd67d5d37d25e853d0330132c72ca7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}